                                            reflect the aggregate grant date fair value of Restricted Shares, computed in accordance
                                            with FASB ASC Topic 718. Restricted Share grants of 1,024 shares were granted to each director
                                            of the Company on February 5, 2025 at a price of $23.43 per share and all shares vested on
                                            August 5, 2025 with a vesting price of $20.25.</span></td></tr></table><div>

