    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Chairman, President &amp; CEO</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">SB Financial Group, Inc.</span></td></tr>
