    </div><!-- Field: /Page --><div>
</div><p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><img alt="" src="ea027969001_img5.jpg" style="height: 1050px; width: 811px"/></p><div>

</div><p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White">V83917 - P44620 Important Notice Regarding the Availability of Proxy Materials for the Annual Meeting: The Notice and Proxy Statement  and Annual Report are available at www.proxyvote.com. SB FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. Annual Meeting of Shareholders  April 22, 2026 10:30 AM, EDT This proxy is solicited  by the Board of Directors The shareholder(s) hereby appoint(s) Mark A . Klein and Anthony V . Cosentino, or either of them, as proxies, each with the power to appoint their substitute, and hereby authorize(s) them to represent and to vote, as designated on the reverse side of this ballot, all of the shares of common stock of SB FINANCIAL GROUP, INC . that the shareholders are entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting of Shareholders to be held on Wednesday, April 22 , 2026 at 10 : 30 AM, EDT, at the Company's headquarters, 401 Clinton St . , Defiance, OH 43512 , and virtually at www . virtualshareholdermeeting . com/SBFG 2026 , and any adjournment(s) or postponement(s) thereof . This proxy, when properly executed, will be voted in the manner directed herein . If no such direction is made, this proxy will be voted in accordance with the Board of Directors' recommendations . Continued and to be signed on reverse side</p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 45; Options: Last --><div>
